Template: triheart/grub/update-nvram
Type: boolean
Default: true
Description: Update EFI boot entries to boot TriHeart Archlinux automatically?
Description-zh_CN.UTF-8: 更新 EFI 启动项以自动引导 TriHeart Archlinux？

Template: triheart/grub/install
Type: text
Description: Installing Arch Linux GRUB and building the boot configuration

Template: triheart/grub/installation-media
Type: text
Description: The EFI partition ${DEVICE} belongs to Ventoy. Return to manual partitioning and select the installed system's EFI partition.
Description-zh_CN.UTF-8: EFI 分区 ${DEVICE} 属于 Ventoy。请返回手动分区，指定目标系统的 EFI 分区。

Template: triheart/grub/failed
Type: error
Description: Boot loader installation failed
 ${REASON}
 .
 See the grub-installer messages in /var/log/syslog. A copy is saved
 in /var/log/installer/grub-installer.log on the installed system.
Description-zh_CN.UTF-8: 引导器安装失败
 ${REASON}
 .
 请查看 /var/log/syslog 中的 grub-installer 日志。日志副本保存在目标系统的 /var/log/installer/grub-installer.log。
